{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/extras/GIF_one_final_adventure.gif?t=1743238700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A disconcertingly amusing and highly original point and click adventure game in 1990s style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/extras/HORNYHUNTERGIF4.5.gif?t=1743238700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/extras/Features.gif?t=1743238700\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sort-of classic 6 Verb interface with cunning puzzles to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bizarre and hilarious characters set in a rich fantasy/South Yorkshire world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 2 hour demo with 15 locations to explore with additional cut scenes\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 minutes of original musical compositions and recordings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An enthralling story of espionage and high adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No knowledge of the previous Brownie's Adventure games is required!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/extras/KnobbitonGIF_4.5.gif?t=1743238700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/extras/er_what.gif?t=1743238700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unemployed Pilchard Press engineer turned wizard has retired at last. Life is good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've endangered the world, but then saved it. Sort of a mixed bag really when you think about it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The people of South Yorkshire and North East Derbyshire have\u2014somehow\u2014migrated to our world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is, of course, deeply inconvenient. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But not as inconvenient as the possible return of Grundolph, an evil wizard who, much like damp, can never truly be eradicated. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Which is very useful from a writing perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter Brownie: overweight, mid-life-crisis-ridden, and wholly unprepared. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With only a questionable grasp on magic, an array of equally questionable companions, and a handful of action verbs, he must stumble, puzzle, and maybe even get his little cloak thing dirty along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/extras/ezgif-3-0e118e0c84.gif?t=1743238700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424080?t=1743238700","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424080?t=1743238700","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/ee811326b9053092c8451022f01101788ae03d71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743238700","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/ee811326b9053092c8451022f01101788ae03d71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743238700","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains naughty words and above knee length kilts."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/extras/GIF_one_final_adventure.gif?t=1743238700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A disconcertingly amusing and highly original point and click adventure game in 1990s style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/extras/HORNYHUNTERGIF4.5.gif?t=1743238700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/extras/Features.gif?t=1743238700\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sort-of classic 6 Verb interface with cunning puzzles to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bizarre and hilarious characters set in a rich fantasy/South Yorkshire world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 2 hour demo with 15 locations to explore with additional cut scenes\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 minutes of original musical compositions and recordings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An enthralling story of espionage and high adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No knowledge of the previous Brownie's Adventure games is required!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/extras/KnobbitonGIF_4.5.gif?t=1743238700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/extras/er_what.gif?t=1743238700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unemployed Pilchard Press engineer turned wizard has retired at last. Life is good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've endangered the world, but then saved it. Sort of a mixed bag really when you think about it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The people of South Yorkshire and North East Derbyshire have\u2014somehow\u2014migrated to our world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is, of course, deeply inconvenient. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But not as inconvenient as the possible return of Grundolph, an evil wizard who, much like damp, can never truly be eradicated. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Which is very useful from a writing perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter Brownie: overweight, mid-life-crisis-ridden, and wholly unprepared. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With only a questionable grasp on magic, an array of equally questionable companions, and a handful of action verbs, he must stumble, puzzle, and maybe even get his little cloak thing dirty along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/extras/ezgif-3-0e118e0c84.gif?t=1743238700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Beardy Ramblin Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3213350","name":"Brownie's Adventure: The Final Resolution"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424080/header.jpg?t=1743238700","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109035,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109035/movie480.mp4?t=1740943720","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109035/movie_max.mp4?t=1740943720"},"name":"Snappy","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257109035/b394e1e31aa4980f57666a53915d6c84b5d7cf6e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740943720","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109035/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740943720","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109035/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740943